+## ONNX-First Exporters
 
-- PyTorch -> ONNX -> one OpenVINO IR
+Use the direct IR exporters above by default when your target is OpenVINO only. Keep the ONNX-first path when you need format parity with other backends, want to inspect intermediate ONNX graphs, or need to compare OpenVINO conversion against a TensorRT pipeline built from the same ONNX exports.
 
-This is the better choice when:
