-- you want a simpler parity check against one exported model directory
-- you are comfortable preparing `position_ids` and initial diffusion `actions` at runtime
+- Pros: easier cross-backend comparison, same ONNX artifacts can feed TensorRT, useful when validating conversion differences from a shared intermediate format.
+- Cons: one extra conversion stage, more files to manage, usually not the simplest path when OpenVINO IR is the final target.
 
