 ## Output Behavior
 
-During inference the scripts print:
+### Multi-Component Inference (`run_base_ov_inference.py`)
+
+During split / multi-component OV inference, the script prints:
 
 - checkpoint path
 - OpenVINO model directory
-- dataset path (ALOHA) or dummy observation info (base)
-- embodiment adapter name
-- camera configuration
-- selected mode
+- embodiment tag
+- device
+- whether full OV is enabled
+- whether fused DiT is enabled
+- sample / warmup counts
+- language, image size, input seed, and diffusion seed
+- modality details such as video keys, state keys, state dims, action keys, and language keys
+- dummy observation tensor shapes and dtypes
 - warmup timing
 - per-iteration timing
 - averaged timing breakdown
 
-The timing summary separates:
+When timing breakdown logging is enabled, the breakdown separates:
 
 - ViT
 - LLM prep
 - LLM
 - VL self-attention
 - state encoder
-- fused DiT or 4-component diffusion loop
+- fused DiT or non-fused 3-component diffusion loop
+
+### Single-OV Inference (`run_base_single_ov_inference.py`)
+
+During single-OV inference, the script prints:
+
+- checkpoint path when provided, or config-only mode information when `--model-path` is omitted
+- OpenVINO model directory
+- the resolved single XML model path
+- embodiment tag
+- device
+- sample / warmup counts
+- whether `--verify-pytorch` is enabled
+- input seed, diffusion seed, language, and image size
+- modality details such as video keys, state keys, state dims, action keys, and language keys
+- dummy observation tensor shapes and dtypes
+- prepared single-OV input tensor shapes and dtypes
+- static LLM seq_len from metadata when present
+- static reshape details when `--static-shape` is enabled
+- warmup timing
+- per-iteration timing summary
+- final latency summary with mean, median, min, max, and FPS
+
+When `--verify-pytorch` is enabled, the script also prints parity metrics for:
+
+- raw `action_pred`
+- trimmed `action_pred`
+- padded-tail-only comparison when applicable
+- active action dimension information
